This branch ("proprietary-edition") diverges from the MIT-licensed
`master` branch of this repository specifically to carry a commercial
licensing/entitlement-enforcement layer (see AnimusCore_v1/animus_license.hpp
and BENCHMARKS.md's Phase 17 section). Distributing that enforcement
mechanism under the same MIT terms as `master` would be self-defeating --
MIT already grants unrestricted use, copying, and redistribution, which
would include the enforcement code itself.

